// ==========================================================
// Detection: Privileged Role Assignment
// Description: Detects assignment of privileged roles that may
//              provide an account with elevated permissions.
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1098 - Account Manipulation
// Tactic: Persistence / Privilege Escalation
// Severity: High
// Data Source: AuditLogs
// False Positives: Approved administrator changes,
//                  PIM activations, planned access changes
// Response Playbook: create-incident
// Author: Aruna Oluwaseun
// Last Updated: August 2026
// ==========================================================

SigninLogs
| where ResultDescription has "account is disabled"
| project TimeGenerated, UserPrincipalName, IPAddress
| order by TimeGenerated desc